---
description: Aegis UX quality rules
alwaysApply: true
---
- Aegis is not a generic chat interface.
- Make money, evidence, status, next action and permissions visually dominant.
- Show action states: proposed → approved → executing → confirmed/failed.
- Explain AI conclusions through sources/provenance.
- Every important interaction needs loading, error and empty states.
- Meet keyboard, focus, semantic and reduced-motion accessibility needs.
